      <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Continuing a sentence: if you pause and dictate again, Murmur joins it to the same sentence instead of adding a full stop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automatic updates: Murmur now checks for updates daily (menu → Check for Updates…).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also from v0.2: faster, more accurate dictation with on-device cleanup, a polished first-run setup, and a refreshed menu bar experience.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
